metadata/_sms_note = "Pass 151: the Boo (Telesa), Hotel Delfino's ghost. Place it where it should FLOAT (it keeps that height and bobs 50-100 units over it; +Z is its face) with a Graph of Node3D children to drift between, or it roams within WanderRadiusUnits. Kind: Loop (the hotel's -- fades in for ~3 s, out, hidden ~5 s, again), Box (the PINK one, always visible), Normal (invisible until sprayed), CanSee (always visible). It hurts you on touch unless you are above it, and your jump passes straight through it -- until you HOSE it: a spray knocks it back, shows it and stuns it (it sinks to the floor, solid); NOW jump on it (or ground-pound) and it pops (the down clip, coins). The stun ends by itself and it drifts off. A BOX Boo sprayed turns into a pink Boo BLOCK you can stand on for 25 s (it blinks before the Boo comes back); jumping on a box Boo only makes it flinch. Knobs: Kind, Deviations (SpeedScale), Effects (the change puff, the drool slot, the block scene), Sounds (eight slots); RelaunchTicks -1 = gone for good."

